silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_olog_foundation_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 02_bridge_to_olog_foundation #3', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Bridge to Olog Node-Arrow Foundation' the bare symbol OlogBox anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
